OL,3,GNEWSATown criers celebrate their
OL,4,A'corners of the world'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWearing an ornate waistcoat, a tricorn
OL,7,Fhat, knee-length breeches, long white
OL,8,Fsocks, leather shoes with polished
OL,9,Fbrass buckles - and often armed with a
OL,10,Fhand-held bell - the town crier harks
OL,11,Fback to a bygone era. With two towns in
OL,12,FCornwall currently advertising for
OL,13,Fpeople to fill the historic roles, we
OL,14,Fspoke to some about what they bring to
OL,15,Fcommunities in the South West.
OL,17,F"Oyez, Oyez, Oyez. Although it's
OL,18,Fspelled strangely it gives me such joy,
OL,19,Fto talk of my hometown the place we
OL,20,Fcall Fowey".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
