OL,3,GNEWSATown criers celebrate their
OL,4,A'corners of the world'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlan Giles from has been town crier for
OL,7,FFowey in Cornwall for the past seven
OL,8,Fyears and this week has been taking on
OL,9,Fcounterparts from around the UK and
OL,10,Fbeyond in the Town Crier World
OL,11,FTournament.
OL,13,FThe competition in Chester has seen 25
OL,14,Ftown criers competing from England, the
OL,15,FChannel Islands, Belgium, Germany, the
OL,16,FNetherlands, Australia, Canada and the
OL,17,FUnited States.
